                "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme “Allotment of Shops in Kisan Bazaar” is implemented by the Uttarakhand Agricultural Production &amp; Marketing Board under the Department of Agriculture, Government of Uttarakhand. The scheme aims to facilitate trade in products other than agricultural produce by providing commercial shops in Kisan Bazaars.\n<br>\n\n",
