                    "process_md": "***Application Process:***\n\n  - Upon receiving information regarding the allotment of shops in the Kisan Bazaar (through notices published in newspapers and displayed at public places), applicants can obtain the tender form from the committee office by paying the prescribed fee.\n  - Complete the tender form and submit it in the tender box on or before the specified due date.\n\n***Selection Process:***\n\n  - The allotment of shops in the Kisan Bazaar is carried out by the Shop Allotment Committee.\n  - Tenders are opened by the Shop Allotment Committee in the presence of the applicants/tenderers.\n  - The committee invites bids from applicants, and selection is based on the highest tender amount.\n  - The shop is allotted to the highest bidder.\n\n<br>\n\n"
                }
